           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "Branding Tips for Del Valle Businesses",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<ul><li>Trucking logos should read clearly on trailer doors at highway speed.</li><li>Keep your company name and number separate from the logo so DOT markings can be added cleanly.</li><li>Event businesses need logos that work on tents, banners and staff shirts.</li><li>Get vector files for vinyl lettering and wraps.</li></ul>",
