          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. Logo Austin designs logos for trucking and logistics companies, with vector files ready for trailer and truck graphics.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Can I get my logo without visiting your office?",
           "classes": []
